From 133219d438a4a9c30abfa3d1a2508462babc327f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 09:12:49 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] Add three-finger swipe gestures to right TPS43

Vendor the geeksville TPS43 driver so three-finger samples report only the
dominant axis, and add a processor that fires one action per touch:
up/down = Mission Control (Ctrl+Up), left/right = adjacent Space.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01V6WqEXBMkvfupWMkUKk7Pc
