-| 2 | `left_wheel_to_hwheel` | REL_WHEELをREL_HWHEELへ変換、値と符号は保持 |
-| 3 | `left_middle_click_mapper` | BTN_1をBTN_2へ変換、DOWN/UPは保持 |
